; MARK: 3-7: 💬 アリサの落とし物
; ==============================================================================
; カットイン
; BGM変更：rAwTell Owk...
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_7_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

# Judge3-7-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:あれは昨日の魔法の……<br>勉強だか研究だかで<br>使ったもんだ。|#0103Trial07_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR7,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"ええ、そうね。<br>たしかにそれが<br>地精の間にあるなんて<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_07_01\">おかしい</link>わ。<br>火精の間に<br>置いていったんですもの。|#0103Trial07_Margo001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ゲストハウスは<br>昨晩どの部屋も<br>密室だったはずです。<br>だとすると、<br>人形は時空間を<br>超越したことに<br>なっちゃいますよ？|#0103Trial07_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:となると<br>考えられる可能性は……<br>【魔法】……<br>でしょうか……？|#0103Trial07_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"<link=\"Objection_01_03_07_02\">【テレポート】</link>、<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_07_03\">【すり抜け】</link>、<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_07_04\">【透明化】</link>……<br>そのあたりの<br>魔法が使えたら<br>密室を無視することも<br>できるのかしら？|#0103Trial07_Margo002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR9,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:んなもん<br>誰が使えんだよ！|#0103Trial07_Alisa002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:さあ？<br>もしかするとこの中には<br>いないのかもしれないわ？|#0103Trial07_Margo003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆脅かす
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"<link=\"Objection_01_03_07_05\">【第三者】</link>や<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_07_06\">【幽霊】</link>……<br>昨日の実験で<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_07_07\">良くない者</link>を<br>呼び出したり<br>してしまったのかも<br>しれないわね？|#0103Trial07_Margo004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆恐怖
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Fearful1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そんなん……<br>嘘でしょぉ……。|#0103Trial07_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"でもそうでもないと、<br>あの<link=\"Objection_01_03_07_08\">部屋の状況</link>は<br>説明できないもの。|#0103Trial07_Margo005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmR1,ArmL10,Eyes1_Normal_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:超常現象を<br>否定はしないけれど、<br>何が起こったのか<br>わからずに<br>受け入れるわけには<br>いかないわ。|#0103Trial07_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR1_2,ArmL5,Eyes2_Normal_Open1,Mouth2_Surprised_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"なら……<br>逆にどんな<link=\"Objection_01_03_07_09\">現象</link>が<br>起こったのか<br>考えてみるのは<br>どうでしょう？<br>たとえば……<br>天気とか、風の影響とか……。|#0103Trial07_Meruru002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆悔しげ
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そんな自然現象に<br>遠野が殺されて……<br>たまるかよ。|#0103Trial07_Alisa003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
