@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:アリサちゃんの人形を置いていった時のこと……<br>詳しく教えて欲しいな。|#0103Trial07_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:ええ、いいわよ。|#0103Trial07_Margo006| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:魔法の実験をしていたのだけど、<br>遅くなってきたから私たちは帰ろうとしたの。|#0103Trial07_Margo007| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Serious_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:そしたら……帰り際に看守と鉢合わせしたんだ。|#0103Trial07_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Serious_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:隠れて実験してたのがバレたのかと思って<br>慌てて出たんだが……。|#0103Trial07_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:拷問でもされたら大変だもの。<br>だから、アリサちゃんの人形は咄嗟に<br>棚に押し込んで部屋を出たわ。|#0103Trial07_Margo008| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:あとで取りに来ればいいと思ってね。|#0103Trial07_Margo009| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR4,ArmL5,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:つまり……<br>ゲストハウスの中に、置いていったってこと？|#0103Trial07_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left
